==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The Shadow Boxer K is at a pretty low magnification, so this shouldn't be too hard. Running a singular meatshield isn't too bad of an idea here.

